<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Herman Miller started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Herman Miller started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Wednesday it had started coverage of furniture maker Herman Miller Inc with a rating of near- and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 44-1/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
